  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rio Negro Indigenous Fund Project (FIRN)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consolidation of the Rio Negro Indigenous Fund (FIRN). The Fund  finances projects and initiatives from grasroots associations, developed during the elaboration of the territorial and environmental management plans (PGTAs) of the indigenous lands of Rio Negro.The project aims to continue contributing to the autonomy and sustainable development of the Rio Negro&#x2019;s indigenous communities, fostering the social and climate justice.</narrative>
  </description>
